  "notes": "FINANCIAL TERMS:\n- {配当金|はいとうきん}: dividend payment\n- {配当利回|はいとうりまわ}り: dividend yield\n- {高配当|こうはいとう}: high dividend\n- {無配|むはい}: no dividend\n\nTYPES:\n- {中間配当|ちゅうかんはいとう}: interim dividend\n- {期末配当|きまつはいとう}: year-end dividend\n- {特別配当|とくべつはいとう}: special dividend\n\nINVESTMENT CONTEXT:\n{配当|はいとう} is a major factor for investors, especially for {インカム投資|いんかむとうし} (income investing) strategies.\n\nSECOND MEANING:\nIn non-financial contexts, can mean allocation or assignment (e.g., {役割|やくわり}を{配当|はいとう}する - assign roles).",
